"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"CAR-T Cell Therapy - Immunotherapy for Blood Cancers\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-white\"><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-900 via-indigo-900 to-purple-900\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/30\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-white py-32\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><p class=\"text-lg text-purple-200 mb-4 tracking-wider\">免疫治疗方案</p><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-6\">CAR-T血液恶性肿瘤治疗</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-purple-200 mb-4\">CAR-T Cell Therapy for Hematologic Malignancies</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\">革命性个体化免疫疗法 · 改造自身免疫细胞精准攻击癌细胞</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-8\"><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">6,000+例临床输注经验</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">96.4%缓解率</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">2-4周极速排期</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">NMPA批准产品</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><button class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-purple-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-purple-600 transition-colors\">立即咨询</button><button class=\"px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">了解更多</button></div></div></div></section><section id=\"intro\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6\">什么是CAR-T疗法？</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-lg mb-6\">CAR-T（嵌合抗原受体T细胞）疗法是一种革命性的个体化免疫疗法。治疗团队提取患者自身的T细胞，在GMP认证实验室中通过基因工程对其进行改造，使其携带能够精准识别并攻击癌细胞的嵌合抗原受体（CAR）。改造后的CAR-T细胞经扩增后回输患者体内，形成持续发挥抗肿瘤作用的\"活体药物\"。整个过程以患者自身细胞为原料，是目前血液恶性肿瘤领域最前沿的治疗手段之一。</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">截至2026年，中国已完成了超过6,000例CAR-T细胞输注，多款商业化产品已获国家药品监督管理局（NMPA）批准。所有合作医院均采用NMPA正式批准的CAR-T产品，在具备GMP资质的实验室完成细胞制备，并在三甲医院设有专属国际患者服务通道。这意味着患者将在正规监管框架内接受治疗，安全性与可追溯性均有制度保障。</p><div class=\"bg-purple-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-purple-600 mb-1\">6,000+</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">例临床输注</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-purple-600 mb-1\">NMPA</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">批准产品</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160550-2173dba999ef?w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"CAR-T Therapy\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-full\"></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-purple-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">为什么选择中国？</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">六大核心优势，让CAR-T治疗更高效、更经济</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up \"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">世界一流的临床结果</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">多发性骨髓瘤总缓解率高达96.4%，高级别淋巴瘤83%，急性淋巴细胞白血病完全缓解率95.1%。中国临床数据全面达到国际领先水平。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield \"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">显著的费用优势</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">总医疗费用约20万–25万美元（含评估、细胞制备、住院及基本药物），远低于欧美同等治疗（通常超过50万美元）。节省的费用足以覆盖往返机票、全程翻译及住宿安排。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">等待时间极短</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">2–4周即可入组治疗，通过MedKungfu绿色通道可优先安排。欧美同类治疗通常需等待6–12个月。对于病情紧迫的患者，等待时间往往意味着错失最佳治疗窗口。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">国际患者服务完善</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">合作医院设有专属英语服务国际部及便捷的国际患者通道，从入院手续到检查安排均有专人对接，确保海外患者就医无障碍。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-microscope \"><path d=\"M6 18h8\"></path><path d=\"M3 22h18\"></path><path d=\"M14 22a7 7 0 1 0 0-14h-1\"></path><path d=\"M9 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M9 12a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6h6v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 6V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H9a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">临床试验通道灵活</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">中国是全球CAR-T临床试验数量最多的国家之一，适应症范围更灵活。对于在其他国家被判定为\"难以治疗\"或标准疗法无效的患者，中国的临床试验通道提供了额外机会。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users \"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">丰富的真实世界经验</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">截至2026年，合作医院已完成超过4,000例输注，积累了大量针对不同分型、不同病程患者的真实世界数据。医疗团队在处理细胞因子释放综合征（CRS）等常见副作用方面经验丰富。</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-8\">适应症（血液恶性肿瘤）</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">CAR-T疗法主要适用于复发/难治性：</p><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"bg-purple-50 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-purple-500\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 font-medium\">多发性骨髓瘤</span></div><div class=\"bg-purple-50 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-purple-500\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 font-medium\">弥漫大B细胞淋巴瘤</span></div><div class=\"bg-purple-50 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-purple-500\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 font-medium\">急性淋巴细胞白血病</span></div><div class=\"bg-purple-50 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-purple-500\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 font-medium\">套细胞淋巴瘤</span></div><div class=\"bg-purple-50 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-purple-500\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700 font-medium\">其他高级别淋巴瘤</span></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm mt-6\">是否适合接受CAR-T治疗，需由我方合作的医疗团队进行个体化评估。</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-8 text-white\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px);\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">治疗内容</h3><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-purple-400 font-bold\">1.</span><span class=\"text-gray-300\">治疗前评估 – PET-MR、骨髓活检、血液检查、T细胞功能检测</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-purple-400 font-bold\">2.</span><span class=\"text-gray-300\">T细胞采集 – 通过白细胞分离术采集患者T细胞</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-purple-400 font-bold\">3.</span><span class=\"text-gray-300\">CAR-T细胞制备 – 在GMP认证实验室中进行基因改造和扩增</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-purple-400 font-bold\">4.</span><span class=\"text-gray-300\">淋巴细胞清除 – 轻度化疗，为回输做准备</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-purple-400 font-bold\">5.</span><span class=\"text-gray-300\">CAR-T细胞回输 – 一日静脉输注</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-purple-400 font-bold\">6.</span><span class=\"text-gray-300\">住院监测与支持治疗 – 处理细胞因子释放综合征、神经毒性等副作用</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">治疗流程</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">从抵达至出院约3-6周</p></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">1</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">治疗前评估</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">2–3天</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">PET-MR、骨髓活检、血液检查、T细胞功能检测。全面评估病情分期、脏器功能及CAR-T治疗适应症，确认患者符合入组标准。MedKungfu全程双语陪同，协助完成所有检查预约与结果解读。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">2</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">T细胞采集</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">1天</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">通过白细胞分离术（单采术）从患者外周血中采集T细胞，全程约2–4小时，无需麻醉，当日完成。采集完成后，细胞即送往GMP认证实验室进行基因改造。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">3</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">CAR-T细胞制备</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">2–3周</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">采集的T细胞送至GMP认证实验室，进行嵌合抗原受体基因的病毒载体转导和细胞扩增。此阶段患者可暂时离院或在医院附近休养，等待细胞制备完成。MedKungfu协助安排周边住宿与休养计划。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">4</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">淋巴细胞清除化疗</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">3–5天</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">回输前进行轻度化疗（FC方案：氟达拉滨+环磷酰胺），清除体内现有淋巴细胞，为CAR-T细胞的扩增创造空间。此阶段在住院监测下完成，MedKungfu全程陪同协助沟通。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">5</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">CAR-T细胞回输</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">1天</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">CAR-T细胞通过一次静脉输注回输体内，输注过程约30–60分钟。这是整个治疗流程的核心步骤。回输后，改造后的T细胞将在体内持续扩增，精准识别并攻击癌细胞。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">6</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">住院监测与出院随访</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">2–4周</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">住院密切监测，重点管理细胞因子释放综合征（CRS）和免疫效应细胞相关神经毒性（ICANS）等副作用。医疗团队24小时待命，支持治疗完善。病情稳定后可出院，MedKungfu持续协调3–24个月远程随访。</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-900 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">疗效 – 中国临床数据</h2></div><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-700\"><th class=\"text-left py-4 px-4 text-purple-400 font-semibold\">癌症类型</th><th class=\"text-left py-4 px-4 text-purple-400 font-semibold\">总缓解率（ORR）</th><th class=\"text-left py-4 px-4 text-purple-400 font-semibold\">≥完全缓解（CR）率</th><th class=\"text-left py-4 px-4 text-purple-400 font-semibold\">1年总生存率</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-white\">多发性骨髓瘤</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-purple-300 font-bold\">96.4%</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-purple-300 font-bold\">80.4%</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-gray-300\">未明确</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-white\">高级别淋巴瘤（DLBCL等）</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-purple-300 font-bold\">83%</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-purple-300 font-bold\">58%</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-gray-300\">84%</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-white\">白血病（B-ALL）</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-purple-300 font-bold\">未明确</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-purple-300 font-bold\">95.1%</td><td class=\"py-4 px-4 text-gray-300\">73.6%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-600 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 text-white\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6\">案例展示</h2><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">南非奥运冠军（62岁）– 高危多发性骨髓瘤</h3><p class=\"text-purple-100 mb-6\">其在多个国家被判定为\"难以治疗\"。前往上海瑞金医院接受全面评估并顺利进行CAR-T治疗。在中国先进的CAR-T医疗体系支持下成功完成治疗。</p><p class=\"text-purple-200 font-medium\">已有数千名国际患者选择来中国接受CAR-T治疗——您也可以是其中之一。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-8\">参考治疗费用</h2><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center py-3 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0\"><span class=\"text-gray-700\">医疗费（直付医院：评估、CAR-T细胞治疗、最长28天住院、基本药物）</span><span class=\"text-purple-600 font-bold\">$200,000-$250,000</span></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm mt-4\">*具体费用以医院最终评估为准。</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-8\">为什么选择我们？</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-purple-600 mb-2\">合规运营·资金安全</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">公司直接签约收款，资金安全有保障。医院直联，无中间加价，医疗费直付医院，全程透明。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-purple-600 mb-2\">2–4周绿色通道</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">通过MedKungfu合作渠道，优先安排入组评估，大幅缩短等待时间，为病情紧迫的患者争取宝贵窗口。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-purple-600 mb-2\">全程双语支持</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">专属双语医疗协调员全程陪同，覆盖检查预约、病历翻译、医患沟通、院内陪诊及出院手续全环节。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-purple-600 mb-2\">价格透明·退费保障</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">提供明细报价单，7种情形可全额或按比例退费，保障患者权益，无隐性收费。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-purple-600 mb-2\">行前规划·落地协助</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">协助签证邀请函、机场接送、院附近住宿安排，让患者与家属从抵达第一天起无后顾之忧。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-purple-600 mb-2\">长期随访管理</h3><p class=\